<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>About</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/about.css">
</head>
<body>
    <div id="preloader">
  <div class="loader">
    <img src="/images/about us.png" alt="Your Website Logo" />
    <img src="/images/loading.svg" alt="Loading Animation" />
  </div>
</div>
    <div class="container">
    <div class="image">
      <img src="/images/interiorlogo.png" alt="logo">
     
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="content">
    <a href="/">Home</a>
    <a href="/about">About</a>
    <a href="/services">Services</a>
    <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
    <a href="/admin">Admin</a>
  </div>
  <div class="about">
    <p class="aboutus">
      <h1>About Us Interior</h1>
      NS Interior is one of the professional engineering services company founded in 2010 in Delhi and with presence in all India. We successfully established ourselves as a dynamic industry that supplies greener and innovative solutions according to client requests and on demands.

Responsiveness, flexibility, and quality are our hallmarks, and clients expect or deserve them. NS Interior is the Interior Contracting business in Faridabad, Delhi Ncr, Gurgaon, and Noida offers the supply of specialized companies with all of the feature - for a reasonable price and at a fraction of the time required by others. The mission of our organization is to always offer effective solutions to our clients for each engineering conundrum.

Maintaining integrity in our solutions is our standard goal. We ensure quality when providing drawings and documents according to agreed upon deadlines. NS Interior provides the very best solutions for our customers. We bring all our products and capabilities under one roof, so we can guarantee quality service and provide sustainable solutions. We are remarkable because of our many years of expertise within the niche
    </p>
    <img src="/images/about us.png" alt="logo">

  </div>
<div class="clients">


  <h1 class="clients-header">Clients</h1>
  <%for(let data of data1){%>
  <div class="clients-container">
    <img src="<%= data.image %>" alt="logo">
  </div>
  <%}%>
</div>
<div class="customers">

  <h1 class="customers-header">Customers Review</h1>
  <%for(let data of data2){%>
  <div class="customers-container">
    <img src="<%= data.image %>" alt="logo">
    <h3><%= data.name %></h3>
    <p><%= data.review %></p>

  </div>
  <%}%>


</div>

 <footer>
    <p>© 2025 Interior Design. All Rights Reserved.</p>
  </footer>



  
</body>
<script>
  // Hide preloader when page fully loads
  window.addEventListener("load", function() {
    const preloader = document.getElementById("preloader");
    preloader.style.display = "none";
  });
</script>

</html>